Subject: [PATCH] Fix Edge-AI NX 16GB deployment automount race

Scope: local deployment fixes only; original image/rootfs and BSP sources
are unchanged. The latest hardware retry passed GPT/partprobe and started
rootfs copying; final flash completion and normal boot are not yet verified.

Apply from the prepared deployment workspace (.deploy-jetpack-7.2-blacksail),
containing the extracted bundle named demo-image-weston-edge-ai-universal-6.1+snapshot-f94ae3d6ba49aef86f497998c0e0232a5039510a, the original
pre-fix deploy-edge-ai.sh, and deployment-readiness.json from the checked
hardware probe. Paths below are relative to that workspace, not repo root.
The changes are already installed in the active workspace; this patch is
for review/replay. Verify with git apply --check before applying to a copy.

The readiness hunk adds only flash_target configuration; dynamic statuses,
logs and historical probe evidence are deliberately not changed. The target
is the checked board (USB serial 46fc1920, 488397168 sectors, P3767-0000).
Existing deployment_directory remains an absolute path to its extraction;
update it and recheck hardware if reproducing on another host or board.
The canonical helper and profile helper are identical copies.

